{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About this Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers approximately <strong>1 hour of gameplay</strong>, giving you a first look at <strong>Hamstermind's core mechanics and puzzle design</strong>.<br>It also includes <strong>optional challenges</strong> for players looking to put their brains to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rotate the rooms</strong>: Turn the chambers to <strong>create new paths</strong> and reach unexplored areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Move the pieces</strong>: Slide rooms into <strong>empty spaces</strong> to connect with other chambers and progress through the labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729430/extras/Slide.gif?t=1748686443\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Hamstermind</strong>, you play as the legendary <strong>Hamster Jones</strong>, a fearless explorer accompanied by his quirky team. Trapped inside an ancient pyramid, your mission is to <strong>solve complex puzzles</strong> and uncover the mysteries hidden within this sacred place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729430/extras/Characters_lineup_2.png?t=1748686443\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve optional puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on extra challenges for the most daring explorers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729430/extras/CagePuzzle.gif?t=1748686443\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729430?t=1748686443","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com